---
// FraudDetectionExhibit.astro - Benchmark Comparison & Failure Analysis Taxonomy
---

<div class="exhibit-wrapper" id="fraud-detection-exhibit">
  <div class="exhibit-header">
    <div>
      <span class="exhibit-tag font-mono">EXHIBIT 3.1: MODEL EVALUATION &amp; BENCHMARK</span>
      <h3 class="exhibit-title">PR-AUC &amp; Precision-Recall Benchmark on 56,746 Test Transactions</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="font-mono text-xs status-note">
      <a href="https://credit-card-fraud-detection-aryan0405.streamlit.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="live-pill">
        <span class="status-dot deployed"></span> View Live Streamlit App ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sr-only">
    Benchmark comparison table across Logistic Regression, Main XGBoost with class weighting, and FLAML tuned XGBoost on 56,746 transactions with 95 frauds. The main XGBoost model achieves 0.79 PR-AUC with 18 false positives and 23 false negatives.
  </div>

  <!-- Real Measured Benchmark Table -->
  <div class="table-container font-mono">
    <table class="benchmark-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">Model Architecture</th>
          <th scope="col">Decision Cutoff</th>
          <th scope="col">Precision</th>
          <th scope="col">Recall</th>
          <th scope="col">F1 Score</th>
          <th scope="col">PR-AUC</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Logistic Regression (Baseline)</td>
          <td>0.50</td>
          <td>0.85</td>
          <td>0.59</td>
          <td>0.70</td>
          <td>0.69</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="main-row">
          <td><strong>XGBoost (Main Model with Scale Weight)</strong></td>
          <td>0.50</td>
          <td>0.80</td>
          <td>0.76</td>
          <td>0.78</td>
          <td><strong>0.79</strong></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>FLAML-Tuned XGBoost (AutoML Ceiling)</td>
          <td>0.2222*</td>
          <td>0.96</td>
          <td>0.77</td>
          <td>0.85</td>
          <td>0.82</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <span class="table-footnote">*Note from repository: FLAML threshold was selected by maximizing F1 on the test set; in practice at threshold 0.5 it yields precision 0.99, recall 0.75.</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Failure Analysis Taxonomy Breakdown -->
  <div class="failure-analysis-box font-mono">
    <span class="fa-title">SHAP-BASED FAILURE ANALYSIS TAXONOMY (41 TOTAL ERRORS ACROSS 56,746 SAMPLES):</span>
    <div class="failure-grid">
      <div class="failure-card">
        <div class="fc-head">
          <span class="fc-type">TYPE 1: BORDERLINE CASES</span>
          <span class="fc-fix">[Addressable via Threshold Slider]</span>
        </div>
        <p class="fc-desc">
          Transactions hovering directly around the 0.5 decision boundary (probabilities between 0.40 and 0.60). 
          These can be controlled interactively in the Streamlit application to favor recall over precision depending on fraud risk tolerance.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="failure-card alert-card">
        <div class="fc-head">
          <span class="fc-type alert-text">TYPE 2: CONFIDENT MISSES</span>
          <span class="fc-fix alert-text">[Feature Blindness / Anonymized PCA Overlap]</span>
        </div>
        <p class="fc-desc">
          Transactions where anonymized PCA components (V1-V28) completely overlap with legitimate spending distributions. 
          Cannot be fixed by threshold tuning alone; requires raw behavioral transaction metadata.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .exhibit-wrapper {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    margin: var(--space-6) 0 var(--space-8);
  }

  .exhibit-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .exhibit-header {
      flex-direction: row;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
    }
  }

  .exhibit-tag {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .exhibit-title {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .live-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    color: var(--color-status-deployed);
    text-decoration: underline;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .table-container {
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin: var(--space-4) 0;
  }

  .benchmark-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    text-align: right;
  }

  .benchmark-table th, .benchmark-table td {
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .benchmark-table th:first-child, .benchmark-table td:first-child {
    text-align: left;
  }

  .benchmark-table th {
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    color: var(--color-ink-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .main-row {
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-ink-primary);
  }

  .table-footnote {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    display: block;
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  .failure-analysis-box {
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  .fa-title {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink-primary);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .failure-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .failure-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .failure-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: var(--space-3);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .failure-card.alert-card {
    border-color: var(--color-border-strong);
  }

  .fc-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .fc-type {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink-primary);
  }

  .fc-fix {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--color-status-deployed);
  }

  .alert-text {
    color: var(--color-accent) !important;
  }

  .fc-desc {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-ink-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>
